{"t":"Thalassara","s":"thalassara-5e39c","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Doctor_Marrow_NPC_8ebadf.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Thalassara</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Marapur\">Marapur</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/illuminated-warrior-outfits-quest\">Illuminated Warrior Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/make-believe-quest\">Make Believe Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F15.30.a30dad\">15.30.a30dad</a><br/>July 13, 2026<br/>Summer Update 2026</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Links</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3RyZWV0c19vZl9UaGFsYXNzYXJhP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Streets of Thalassara (page does not exist)\">Streets</span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhhbGFzc2FyYV9CdWlsZGluZ3M/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Thalassara Buildings (page does not exist)\">Buildings</span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Towns</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Thalassara</b> is a distant and secluded kingdom, long isolated from the outside world by treacherous coral reefs and shifting coastal formations. Its people developed a distinct culture centred around art, scholarship, craftsmanship, and magical research under the rule of monarchs seated upon the ancient Coral Throne.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Geography\">Geography</span></h2>\n<p>Thalassara is known for its unusual coral formations, fossilised reefs, and ancient stone structures. Massive coral growths cover hillsides and cliffs, while marine fossils and remnants can be found far inland. These features have led scholars to speculate that the land may once have been beneath the sea.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Culture_and_Civilization\">Culture and Civilization</span></h2>\n<p>Coral is deeply integrated into Thalassaran life. Through traditional techniques and magic, it is shaped into tools, ornaments, buildings, and arcane devices. In Coralmar, polished coral structures are said to glow faintly beneath the moonlight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Moonstone_Fragment\">The Moonstone Fragment</span></h2>\n<p>Thalassara's isolation was disrupted by the fall of a moonstone fragment in the southern part of the kingdom. The event attracted explorers, scholars, mercenaries, and other outsiders, while the discovery of <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTW9vbnNpbHZlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Moonsilver (page does not exist)\">Moonsilver</span> brought further attention to the region.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Moonborn_Threat\">The Moonborn Threat</span></h2>\n<p>The fallen moon fragments spawned strange creatures that began spreading throughout Thalassara. The once-isolated kingdom now faces a growing threat while becoming a centre of international interest and conflict.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legacy_and_Significance\">Legacy and Significance</span></h2>\n<p>Thalassara's ancient traditions, mysterious landscape, and connection to coral continue to make it a unique kingdom. The arrival of the moonstone fragment and the discovery of moonsilver have begun a new chapter in its history, bringing the secluded realm into contact with the wider world.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span id=\"w-Thalassara_NPCs_.281_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Thalassara_NPCs_(1_NPCs)\">Thalassara NPCs (1 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Doctor%20Marrow%20%28NPC%29\">Doctor Marrow (NPC)</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Doctor%20Marrow%20%28NPC%29\"><img alt=\"Doctor Marrow (NPC)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Doctor_Marrow_NPC_8ebadf.gif\" width=\"95\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Unknown.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">At <a href=\"#/wiki/Radiant%20Skyhold\">Radiant Skyhold</a>.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Bosses\">Bosses</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["illuminated-warrior-outfits-quest","make-believe-quest"]}